     "content_html": "The loop iterates over all integer values in the list. If a value is less than <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>, the value will be printed, and if the value is greater than <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>, the code prints \"<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Not all numbers are less than 5.</code>\" and the code's execution terminates."
